192: Each repeated index labels exactly one graph edge; its upper and lower
193: occurrences supply one inverse metric. The machine-readable companion
194: \texttt{results/rank81\_basis.json} gives the edge lists, adjacency matrices,
195: formula hashes, and contraction costs.
